#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Expanded draws more above and below fields, battles and the world map, "
"including menu backdrops. The title zooms to fill."
msgstr "扩展后绘制更多上下字段、战斗和世界地图,包括菜单背景。标题缩放以填充 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "As large as the window allows, in the aspect's shape."
msgstr "视窗所允许的大小,以侧面的形状."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Each PS1 pixel a whole number of window pixels: sharp and even."
msgstr "每个PS1像素都有完整的数个窗口像素:锐利且均匀."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "The whole window, whatever its shape."
msgstr "整个窗户,不管它是什么形状。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Beside a 4:3 picture in a wide frame (movies): black bars, the picture "
