msgstr "导出为..."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Choose a save above to export it as an .mcs file; Import puts an .mcs save "
"from the file on this card."
msgstr "选择上面的保存以导出为 . mcs 文件; 导入时会将 . mcs 从此卡的文件中保存出来 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"The game is using this card right now: go back to the game and try again in "
"a moment."
msgstr "游戏现在使用这张卡片:回到游戏中,在一瞬间再试一次."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Replace all saves in slot %d with this backup? The current card will be "
"kept in its backup history."
msgstr "用此备份替换所有保存在 %d 槽中的保存 ? 当前的卡片将保存在备份历史中 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "The card changed or is in use. Cancel and select its backup again."
msgstr "该卡已更改或正在使用中。 取消并再次选择备份 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Restore whole card"
msgstr "恢复整张卡片"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"A save of that name is on the card in slot %d already. Replace it with the "
"one in the file?"
msgstr "%d号机位的卡片上已经存了这个名字。 把它替换为文件中的那个吗 ?"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Replace"
msgstr "替换"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Keep the one on the card"
msgstr "把那个放在牌上"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Nothing imported"
msgstr "无进口"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Off: 30 frames per second"
msgstr "关闭: 每秒30帧"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "On: 60 frames per second"
msgstr "时间: 每秒60帧"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Enhanced engine only (System > Engine)."
msgstr "仅限增强引擎(System > Engine)."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Reduces card/loading waits and field/battle stalls, and enables smooth "
"field motion at 60 Hz by default. Gameplay, animation events, movies and "
"audio stay at normal speed. Off keeps original timing and frame cadence."
msgstr "减少卡片/装填等待和战地/战地摊位,并允许在默认情况下在60赫兹平滑的战地运动。游戏、动画事件、电影和音频保持正常速度。关闭时段和帧。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Character and Gear battles at 2x or 4x: the game runs that many of its own "
"frames per picture, so turns, damage and every random roll come as at 1x, "
"only sooner. Music keeps its tempo; sound effects keep their pitch. Menus, "
"target selection, dialogue and the first moments of each attack name run at "
"1x. In a battle, Tab (or Select + R2 together on a gamepad) steps 1x, 2x, "
"4x. Off: the original speed, and the control does nothing."
msgstr ""
"字符和Gear战斗在 2x 或 4x 进行: 游戏运行的是每个图片的许多自己的帧, 所以转弯,损坏和每个随机卷来的时间都比 1x 更早, "
"音乐会保持它的节奏; 声音效果会保持它们的音效. Menus, 目标选择, 对话框和每个攻击名称的第一瞬间运行在 1x 。 在战斗中, Tab( "
"或在游戏盘上选择 + R2 ) 步骤 1x, 2x, 4x 。 关闭: 原速度, 控制一无所获 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"The field and the world map at 2x or 4x, their scenes and dialogue "
"included: the game runs that many of its own frames per picture. Menus, "
"movies and battles keep their own speed (Battle speed above is the "
"battles'). On the field and the world map, Tab (or Select + R2 together on "
"a gamepad) steps 1x, 2x, 4x; while this is on, Select there does its own "
"job (the area map, the minimap) as you let it go, and nothing when pressed "
"with L1, R1, L2, R2 or Square. Off and 1x: the original speed; off, the "
"control does nothing."
msgstr ""
"2x或4x的场面和世界地图,他们的场景和对话包括: 游戏运行了每个图片的许多自己的帧. Menus,电影和战斗保持自己的速度(Battle speed "
"up is the battle's) 球场和世界地图上, Tab(或选择+R2一起在游戏板上) 步骤 1x, 2x, 4x; 而此时, "
"选择在您放行时会做自己的工作( 区域地图, 迷你地图) , 在按L1, R1, L2, R2 或 Square. Off和 1x: 原始速度; "
"关闭时, 控制无所作为 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Opening the main menu from the field or the world map and closing it, and "
"going from room to room on the field, at 4x: the fades, the loads and the "
"menu's own animation pass in a quarter of the time (with Speedup as well, "
"about half a second for the menu each way and a quarter of a second for a "
"room change). The menu itself, the field and every other screen keep their "
"speed; music keeps its tempo. Off: the original transitions."
msgstr ""
"打开来自球场或世界地图的主菜单并关闭它,从房间到球场,在4x:淡出,负载和菜单本身的动画在四分之一的时间里通过(还有Speedup,每条路的菜单大约半秒,换房间大约四分之一秒),菜单本身,球场和所有其他屏幕保持速度;音乐保持其节奏. Off:原始的过渡."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Draws heavy scenes as slowly as the PS1 did: each picture takes the vblanks "
"the console's CPU needed for it, from a model of its time (an idle Gear "
"battle shows a new picture every third vblank). The game keeps its speed. "
"Original engine only; Speedup, Battle speed, Field speed and online play "
"leave it off. Off: every picture the game asks for, as fast as the PC draws "
"it."
msgstr ""
"绘制的场景和PS1一样缓慢: 每张照片都取下控制台的CPU所需的vblank, 从其时代的模型( 闲置的Gear战斗显示每三分之一的vblank ) "
"。 游戏保持其速度 。 仅限原引擎 ; 速度、 战斗速度、 战地速度和网络游戏 。 关闭: 游戏要求的每张照片, 与 PC 绘制的速度一样快 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Fixes Gear-shop Ether amp, Billy's ammo elements on equipment/status "
"refresh, missing/stray portrait pixels on the next portrait load, Def UP, a "
"name's final 's' (US), the shop's Buy/Sell/Exit arrow (US), MP for EP in "
"the party menu, field sound loops a menu cut off, and a jump pressed just "
"as a random battle comes (the battle then starts when you land)."
msgstr ""
"Fixes Gear-shop Ether anp, Billy在设备/状态刷新上的弹药元素, 下一张肖像负载上的缺失/纹理肖像像素, Def UP, "
"一个名字的终极's(US), 商店的Buy/Sell/Exit箭头(US), 派对菜单中EP的MP, 野外声音循环一个菜单被切断, 以及一个跳跃, "
"恰好随机战斗即将到来(然后战斗在降落时开始)."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Prevents a camera stall during one late-game boss attack."
msgstr "防止一个镜头摊位 在一场晚赛老板的攻击。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Frame rate & motion"
msgstr "帧率与动态效果"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "All 60 Hz"
msgstr "全60赫兹"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%d of 3 on"
msgstr "3号机中的%d"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "30 Hz"
msgstr "30赫兹"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Smoothed"
msgstr "平滑状态"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "60 Hz & motion"
msgstr "60 Hz 运动( M)"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"60 Hz fields, world map and battles (Enhanced engine), plus motion "
"smoothing and high refresh rates."
msgstr "60赫兹场,世界地图和战斗(增强引擎),加上运动平滑和高刷新速率."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Fields run their logic every vblank: input every vblank, the player, "
"sprites and camera moving every frame at their authored speed, scripts, "
"dialogue, random encounters and effects at their authored cadence. Fields "
"authored at 20 or 15 frames per second keep that. Takes effect at once."
msgstr ""
"字段运行每个 vblank 的逻辑: 输入每个 vblank, 播放器, 显示器和相机按其作者的速度移动每个帧, 脚本, 对话框, 随机碰头和效果 。 "
"字段以 20 或 15 帧/ 秒保存它 。 立即生效 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"The Original engine runs fields as the PlayStation did, at 30 frames per "
"second."
msgstr "原发动机运行场与PlayStation一样,每秒30帧."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Authored rate"
msgstr "授权费率"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"The few rooms the game draws at 20 or 15 frames per second (with 60 Hz "
"fields): at 60 Hz too, exact against the Original at every native frame "
"(the default), or at their own rate, for a comparison."
msgstr ""
"游戏中为数不多的几间房间每秒画20或15帧(含60赫兹字段):同样是60赫兹,在每个原生帧(默认)上精确地与原生帧相对照,或按自己的速率进行对比."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"The world map draws every vblank: the party, vehicles, camera, clouds and "
"dust move every frame, and the game itself (input, random encounters, the "
"rest) runs at its authored cadence, exactly as on the PlayStation. Story "
"scenes on the world map keep 30 frames per second. Takes effect at once."
msgstr ""
"世界地图绘制每幅vblank: 派对, 车辆, 相机, 云尘移动每个帧, 而游戏本身( 输入, 随机相遇, 其余) 运行在它的作者cadence, "
"和PlayStation 完全一样 。 世界地图上的故事场景保持每秒30帧。 立即生效 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"The Original engine runs the world map as the PlayStation did, at 30 frames "
"per second."
msgstr "原版引擎运行世界地图与PlayStation一样,每秒30帧."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Battles move every vblank: the Gears' animation, which the game steps every "
"other frame, and what follows it, while the battle itself (turns, damage, "
"random rolls) runs exactly as on the PlayStation. Takes effect at once."
msgstr ""
"Battles move every vblank: The "
"Gears的动画,游戏会按其他的帧逐一进行,以及后续的内容,而战斗本身(转弯,损坏,随机卷)则与PlayStation号完全相同. 立即生效."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "The Original engine runs battles as the PlayStation did."
msgstr "原型发动机像PlayStation号一样运行战斗."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths fields and the world map: models, Gears, terrain, character "
"placement, camera motion, particles, clouds and screen effects. Gameplay, "
"animation events and audio keep their original timing."
msgstr "平滑场和世界地图:模型,Gears,地形,人物布置,相机运动,粒子,云和屏幕效果. Gameplay,动画事件和音频保持了最初的时间."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Adds one game frame of display delay (usually 33 ms; up to 67 ms in slower "
"scenes). Animation pictures, text and lighting retain their original timing."
msgstr "添加一个显示延迟的游戏框(通常是33ms;在较慢的场景中最多67ms). 动画图片,文本和照明保留了原来的时间."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Available with Speedup. Supports wide/expanded framing, texture filters, "
"packs and enhanced text. Scene cuts and unsafe state changes use the "
"original picture."
msgstr "可用 Speedup。 支持宽度/ 宽度框架、 纹理过滤器、 包和增强文本。 剪切和不安全状态更改使用原始图片 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Standing aside: the 60 Hz fields and world map already draw every vblank, "
"so at 60 Hz or the native rate the game's own pictures are shown, with no "
"added delay. Higher motion display rates still add pictures between."
msgstr ""
"站到一边: 60 Hz 字段和世界地图已经绘制了每个 vblank, 因此以 60 Hz 或 本地 的 速率 显示游戏自己的图片, 没有额外的延迟 。 "
"更高的运动显示率仍然会在两者之间添加图片 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Speedup defaults to 60 Hz in supported fields. Higher rates add display "
"samples. Shader presets and unsupported scenes use native presentation. "
"Speedup off keeps authentic frame cadence."
msgstr ""
"支持字段的速率默认为 60 Hz 。 更高的速率会添加显示样本 。 阴影预设和不支持的场景会使用本地演示文稿 。 速率关闭会保留正版框架 "
"cadence 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Rates above your monitor's refresh can be discarded. VRR availability "
"depends on your display and desktop; submission rate does not measure "
"visible refreshes."
msgstr "可丢弃显示器刷新值之上的速率。 VRR 可用性取决于您的显示和桌面; 提交率不会测量可见刷新值 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Hard usually uses 2x enemy HP and 1.5x attack and ether, with boss, story "
"and support exceptions. Character starts and Gear equipment stay original. "
"Battle changes apply when the next fight loads. Enemy stats & rewards below "
"has a multiplier for each enemy stat."
msgstr ""
"硬通常使用2x 敌人 HP 和1.5x 攻击和乙醚,有上司,故事和支持的例外. 字符开始和Gear设备保持原创性. Battle changes "
"适用于下一个战斗负载. unemy stats & presidents 下方对每个敌人 stat有乘数."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"When the party falls in a battle that would end the game, choose Retry to "
"fight it again from its start, with the items, HP and Gears you had. Story "
"battles you are meant to lose stay as they are. Difficulty changed here "
"before you choose applies to the retry."
msgstr ""
"当一方陷入一场会结束游戏的战斗时, 请选择 Retry 从开始再与它战斗, 包括您拥有的项目, HP 和 Gears 。 故事战注定要失去停留状态 。 "
"在您选择重试之前, 很难在此更改 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Select, pressed and released on its own, opens and closes a window in the "
"lower right of the battle with each enemy's name, HP and active statuses, "
"named as the game names them; while you choose a target, only the enemy "
"under the cursor. Hidden enemies are not listed; weaknesses stay hidden. HP "
"once beaten: an enemy's HP appears only once you have defeated that kind of "
"enemy before, as the extras' bestiary records it (kept with your settings, "
"across games: a boss beaten in one game shows its HP in the next). Select "
"with L1, R1, L2 or R2 is another control (Select + R2: battle speed)."
msgstr ""
"单独选择、 按住并释放, 打开和关闭战斗右下方的窗口, 以每个敌人的名字、 HP 和活跃状态命名, 并命名为游戏名称; 而选择目标时, "
"仅列出光标下的敌人 。 隐藏的敌人不列出; 弱点仍然隐藏 。 HP 被击败后: 敌人的 HP 只在之前击败过这种敌人时才会出现, "
"正如外加的战时记录的那样( 使用您的设置, 跨游戏 : 在游戏中击败的老板在下一场游戏中显示其 HP ) 。 选择 L1, R1, L2 或 R2 "
"是另一个控制( 选择 + R2: 战斗速度) 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Applies while walking in fields and on the world map. 0%% turns random "
"encounters off; 100%% is the original rate. Story battles still occur."
msgstr "在田野和世界地图上行走时应用. 0%% 转动随机相遇; 100%% 是原始速率,故事战斗仍然发生."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Practice each normal attack gives toward new deathblows. 100%% is original; "
"0%% adds none. Deathblows are still learned after a battle, at their "
"original levels and in their original order."
msgstr "每一次正常的攻击都给新的死亡吹风。 100%%是原始的; 0%%是零增加的。 死亡吹风在一次战斗之后,仍然按照最初的水平和顺序学习。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"A Combo's deathblows follow one another without a break: no charge-up pose "
"before each one after the first, and the jump back into the ready stance "
"only where a deathblow needs it (to start on the enemy's far side, or well "
"away from where the last one ended). The moves, their damage, AP and "
"deathblow learning stay the game's own. Off: the original."
msgstr ""
"Combo的死气旋接踵而至,没有间断:在第一次死亡后,每个人面前没有充电姿势,只有在死气旋需要时(从敌人的远方开始,或远离最后的终点处)才能跳回准备状态。动作,他们的破坏,AP和死气旋的学习都保持了游戏的原样。关闭:原样。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Removes the white flash when a battle starts and the screen shatters, and "
"the full-screen flashes when performing attacks. Fades to and from black "
"stay as they are. Off: the original."
msgstr "战斗开始时去掉白色闪光, 屏幕会碎裂, 执行攻击时去掉全屏幕闪光。 闪光是黑色的。 关闭: 原始的 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "More battles"
msgstr "更多战斗"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Enemy stats & rewards"
msgstr "敌人属性与奖励"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Per-stat enemy multipliers (HP, attack, ether, defence, agility) and "
"EXP/gold multipliers."
msgstr "恒定敌方乘数(HP,攻击,乙醚,防御,敏捷)和EXP/黄金乘数."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Multipliers apply on top of Normal or Hard, in character and Gear battles. "
"Stats stop at their native limits; agility stops at 16. Normal with every "
"multiplier at 100%% keeps the original balance."
msgstr ""
"乘法适用于正常或硬度之上,在字符和Gear战役中. Stats停止在原生极限; 敏捷性停止在16. 正常,每乘以100%%保持原来的平衡."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Reset difficulty"
msgstr "重置难度"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Random battles are the ones the encounter rate controls, while walking in "
"fields and on the world map. Scripted battles are every other fight: "
"bosses, story battles and enemies you walk into. 100%% is original, 0%% "
"gives none. EXP includes ether EXP and reserve characters. To make up for "
"fewer encounters, raise the random-battle rewards: try 200%% with 50%% "
"encounters, or 400%% with 25%%."
msgstr ""
"随机战是遭遇率控制者,同时在田野和世界地图上行走. 拼写战是其他的战斗:老板,故事战和你走进的敌人. 100%%是原创的,0%%给出了零. "
"EXP包括醚 EXP和后备角色. 为了弥补遭遇次数较少,提高随机战绩:尝试200%%与50%%遭遇,或400%%与25%%遭遇."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
