msgstr "删除 %d 表示其他版本"

#: port/src/ui/states.cpp
msgid ""
"States made before an update of the app cannot be loaded by this version: a "
"state holds the program's own memory, which an update moves. Memory card "
"saves carry over."
msgstr "应用程序更新前制作的状态无法被此版本加载: 状态持有程序本身的内存, 更新动作。 内存卡保存会结转 。"

#: port/src/ui/states.cpp
msgid ""
"A save state is the whole game at a moment: loading it goes back there "
"exactly. Loading never changes the memory cards: saves made since stay on "
"them, and the game reads the cards again. Slot saves wait for a point that "
"other compatible versions can resume. Older saves marked \"This version "
"only\" load in the build that saved them. Keep long-term progress on memory "
"cards."
msgstr ""
"保存状态是一瞬间的全部游戏: 装入它会准确返回那里 。 装入永远不会改变内存卡 : 保存在它们上, 而游戏会再次读取这些卡 。 "
"保存槽会等待其它兼容版本可以恢复的点 。 保存它们保存的构造中, 旧时会保存\" 仅此版本 \" 的负载 。 保存内存卡的长期进度 。"

#: port/src/ui/states.cpp
msgid ""
"A save state is the whole game at a moment: loading it goes back there "
"exactly. Loading never changes the memory cards: saves made since stay on "
"them, and the game reads the cards again. States load only in the build of "
"the port that saved them: after the port is updated or rebuilt, older "
"states are refused. Keep long-term progress on memory cards."
msgstr ""
"保存状态是一瞬间的全部游戏: 装入它会准确返回那里 。 装入永远不会改变内存卡 : 保存在它们上, 游戏会再次读取这些卡 。 "
"国家只装入保存它们的端口的建置中 : 更新或重建端口后, 旧状态被拒绝 。 保留内存卡的长期进度 。"

