"The game would ask GitHub for the latest release's small signed file; "
"nothing about you is sent. A new version shows in a corner note and in F1, "
"System, Updates, where this can be changed."
msgstr ""
"游戏会要求GitHub提供最新发行的小型签名文件;没有发送任何关于您的消息. 一个新的版本显示在角音符和F1,System, "
"Updates中,可以在此更改."

